是因为我不想艾米知道
is because I didn't want Amy

372
00:15:54,670 --> 00:15:57,720
我无法在外独立生存
to know I couldn't make it on my own.

373
00:15:58,210 --> 00:15:59,570
这有什么
What's the big deal?

374
00:15:59,570 --> 00:16:01,990
当然这对你来说不算什么
Oh, of course it's no big deal to you.

375
00:16:02,000 --> 00:16:04,430
你视我为偶像  你把我供在神台上
You idolize me, and nothing could ever knock me

376
00:16:04,430 --> 00:16:06,700
没什么可以让我从神台上下来
off that pedestal you put me on.

377
00:16:07,660 --> 00:16:08,510
没错
Well, yeah, it's true.

378
00:16:08,510 --> 00:16:10,570
你对我是神一般的存在
You-you are a god to me.

379
00:16:12,010 --> 00:16:13,460
我可以听了吗
Can I stop now?

380
00:16:13,460 --> 00:16:15,230
告诉她吧
Just tell her.

381
00:16:18,140 --> 00:16:20,230
我打电话给莱纳德是因为
I called Leonard because...

382
00:16:20,230 --> 00:16:21,360
我失败了
I failed.

383
00:16:21,360 --> 00:16:25,640
我不希望你因此轻视我
And I didn't want you to think less of me.

384
00:16:25,640 --> 00:16:28,220
你是担心这个吗
You were worried about that?

385
00:16:29,550 --> 00:16:31,000
是的
Yes.

386
00:16:33,680 --> 00:16:35,530
谢尔顿
Sheldon...

387
00:16:36,420 --> 00:16:39,810
你并不完美的事实  我是可以接受的
it's okay with me that you're not perfect.

388
00:16:44,330 --> 00:16:47,040
我能再和莱纳德说句悄悄话吗
Can I have one more moment with Leonard?

389
00:16:47,040 --> 00:16:49,120
好的
Sure.

390
00:16:56,100 --> 00:16:58,900
艾米伤了我的心  我要和她分手
Amy just hurt my feelings. I want to break up with her.

391
00:17:02,830 --> 00:17:04,870
我没想过我会这样说
Now, I never thought I'd say this,

392
00:17:04,870 --> 00:17:07,520
但能见到谢尔顿了  我还有些小激动呢
but I'm kind of excited to see Sheldon.

393
00:17:08,160 --> 00:17:11,460
我没想过我会这样说  但佩妮今天找到工作了
I never thought I'd say this, but Penny got a job today.

394
00:17:12,470 --> 00:17:13,630
是吗
She did?

395
00:17:13,630 --> 00:17:15,240
她成功的唯一原因
Well, the only reason she got it

396
00:17:15,240 --> 00:17:18,000
是因为面试她的人爱慕我
is 'cause the guy who interviewed her loves me.

397
00:17:24,610 --> 00:17:26,440
你想怎样
What do you want?

398
00:17:26,440 --> 00:17:28,930
我大概感觉到
I, uh, kind of got the feeling

399
00:17:28,930 --> 00:17:32,050
你对我住在你妈家有意见
you might not be okay with me staying at your mom's.

400
00:17:32,050 --> 00:17:33,560
你说得对  我有意见
You're right, I'm not.

401
00:17:33,560 --> 00:17:35,010
我觉得很奇怪
I think it's weird.

402
00:17:35,010 --> 00:17:35,640
华仔
Howie?

403
00:17:35,640 --> 00:17:36,650
本来就是  他是个成年男人
It is. He's a grown man.

404
00:17:36,650 --> 00:17:38,760
他就这样不交房租住下去吗
He's just gonna live there rent-free?

405
00:17:38,760 --> 00:17:40,130
这样如何让他有动力
How is that gonna motivate him

406
00:17:40,130 --> 00:17:42,130
不再懒惰  去找工作
to get off his butt and get a job?

407
00:17:42,130 --> 00:17:44,760
你有人生计划吗
I mean, do you even have a plan?

408
00:17:44,760 --> 00:17:47,190
你又不是我爹  你管我
Hey, you're not my father, okay?

409
00:17:47,190 --> 00:17:49,340
而且  你妈和我谈过了
And besides, your mother and I were talking...

410
00:17:49,340 --> 00:17:51,980
"你妈和我"  你又不是我爹
"Your mother and I"? You're not my father!

411
00:17:51,980 --> 00:17:53,690
-我没说我是你爹  -我也没说
- I didn't say I was your father! - Well, I didn't say

412
00:17:53,690 --> 00:17:55,540
-我是你爹  -好啦  冷静
- I was your father! - Okay, calm down.

413
00:17:55,540 --> 00:17:57,280
你不是他爹  他不是你爹
You're not his father, he's not your father!

414
00:17:57,280 --> 00:18:00,000
谁也不是谁的爹
Nobody's anybody's father.

415
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:02,340
你看不惯我的人生选择我很遗憾
I-I'm sorry you don't like my life choices,

416
00:18:02,340 --> 00:18:03,320
但这是我的人生
but it's my life!

417
00:18:03,320 --> 00:18:05,750
住我的房  就得守我的规矩
Well, it's my house, it's my rules!

418
00:18:06,550 --> 00:18:08,060
好吧  爹
Okay, Dad!

419
00:18:08,060 --> 00:18:10,350
如果我修剪了草坪  可以给我零花钱吗
If I mow the lawn, can I have my allowance?

420
00:18:10,350 --> 00:18:12,550
不准用这种挖苦的语气和他说话
Hey, don't you take that sarcastic tone with him!

421
00:18:12,550 --> 00:18:13,800
我不用听你教训我
I don't have to listen to you!

422
00:18:13,800 --> 00:18:15,020
别这样跟她说话
Don't talk to her like that!

423
00:18:15,020 --> 00:18:16,700
这是我老妈  老婆
That is my mother... Wife!

424
00:18:16,700 --> 00:18:18,920
老婆  我说的是老婆
My wife! I said my wife!

425
00:18:19,540 --> 00:18:20,150
算了
You know what?

426
00:18:20,150 --> 00:18:21,810
这样谈不会有结果的
This isn't getting us anywhere.

427
00:18:21,810 --> 00:18:24,860
你准备好道歉时  知道在哪里找我
When you're ready to apologize, you know where to find me.

428
00:18:24,860 --> 00:18:26,680
知道  我的家
Well, yeah, in my house!

429
00:18:26,680 --> 00:18:29,050
没错  小婊砸
That's right, sucka!

430
00:18:32,110 --> 00:18:34,680
要是我没去旅行就好了
I wish I'd never gone on that trip.

431
00:18:34,680 --> 00:18:37,250
现在比起离开时  心情一点也没好转
I feel no better now than when I left.

432
00:18:37,250 --> 00:18:38,820
但你还是有所成就的
But you still accomplished something.

433
00:18:38,820 --> 00:18:40,520
是的  如果你告诉任何人
Yeah. If you had told anyone

434
00:18:40,520 --> 00:18:43,570
你打算坐火车周游全国
that you were going away on a train by yourself across the country,

435
00:18:43,570 --> 00:18:45,290
你知道人家会怎么说吗
do you know what they would have said?

436
00:18:45,290 --> 00:18:47,330
-我做不到吗  -太对了
- That I couldn't do it? - Exactly.

437
00:18:47,330 --> 00:18:49,790
不过他们先会欢呼一下
Right after they said, "Yay!"

438
00:18:51,230 --> 00:18:52,860
但你做到了
But you did do it.

439
00:18:52,870 --> 00:18:54,930
事情没有完全如你所愿又如何
So what if it didn't all go your way?

440
00:18:54,940 --> 00:18:57,200
这样才是冒险啊
That's what makes it an adventure.

441
00:18:57,200 --> 00:18:59,300
有道理
That's a good point.

442
00:18:59,310 --> 00:19:02,390
我很像灰袍甘道夫
Yeah, I'm a lot like Gandalf the Grey.

443
00:19:03,190 --> 00:19:05,180
他与炎魔战斗
He fought the Balrog and emerged

444
00:19:05,180 --> 00:19:07,820
成为了更强大的白袍甘道夫
stronger than ever as Gandalf the White.

445
00:19:07,820 --> 00:19:10,440
我的电话和裤子被抢了
I was robbed of my phone and pants,

446
00:19:10,440 --> 00:19:12,780
我回来时变得更强大了
and I, too, came back stronger.

447
00:19:12,780 --> 00:19:13,960
也更白了
And whiter, too,

448
00:19:13,960 --> 00:19:16,590
因为我六周没有晒过太阳了
'cause I wasn't in direct sunlight for six weeks.

449
00:19:17,580 --> 00:19:20,720
你瞧  这次旅行对你有好处
See? This trip was good for you.

450
00:19:20,720 --> 00:19:22,040
的确
Indeed.

451
00:19:22,040 --> 00:19:25,500
我是全世界最聪明的毛毛虫
I was the world's smartest caterpillar.

452
00:19:25,500 --> 00:19:29,040
在咱们国家铁路网上化蛹后
And then after pupating in our nation's railway system,

453
00:19:29,040 --> 00:19:30,650
我破茧而出
I've burst forth

454
00:19:30,650 --> 00:19:33,850
变成了全世界最聪明的蝴蝶
as the world's smartest butterfly.

455
00:19:34,940 --> 00:19:37,610
蝴蝶可以自己从亚利桑那州飞回家
Butterfly could've gotten himself home from Arizona.

456
00:19:39,870 --> 00:19:41,770
我感觉重生了
Yeah, I feel renewed.

457
00:19:41,770 --> 00:19:45,270
我准备好面对未来一切的改变
I'm ready to deal with any changes that come my way.

458
00:19:47,520 --> 00:19:48,560
看谁回来了
Look who's back!

459
00:19:48,560 --> 00:19:50,260
你的发型不同了  你换了发型
Your hair is different. You changed your hair.

460
00:19:50,260 --> 00:19:52,110
我接受无能  我走人了
I can't take this. I'm out.

461
00:19:57,640 --> 00:19:59,710
你们想看看我旅行时的照片吗
Would you like to see pictures from my trip?

462
00:19:59,710 --> 00:20:01,140
你的电话不是被偷了吗
I thought your phone got stolen.

463
00:20:01,140 --> 00:20:03,060
是的  但幸运的是所有照片
Yeah, it did, but luckily all my photos

464
00:20:03,060 --> 00:20:04,950
都在云端备份了
got backed up to the Cloud.

465
00:20:04,950 --> 00:20:07,790
原以为守得云开见月明
And you thought they all had a silver lining.

466
00:20:08,250 --> 00:20:09,590
看  第一天
Here-- day one.

467
00:20:09,590 --> 00:20:12,110
这个是我本来要坐的座位
Uh, this was the seat I was going to sit

468
00:20:12,110 --> 00:20:13,030
但我没坐
in but didn't

469
00:20:13,030 --> 00:20:15,750
因为上面有饼干屑
because there were cracker crumbs on it.

470
00:20:15,750 --> 00:20:19,580
因为是一等座  我怀疑是乐之饼干
As it was first class, I suspect Ritz.

471
00:20:20,540 --> 00:20:23,300
这是火车上的厕所
This is the train bathroom.

472
00:20:23,300 --> 00:20:25,330
这是我吃的泻立停
This is the Imodium I took

473
00:20:25,330 --> 00:20:28,430
这样我不必使用火车上的厕所
so I would never have to use the train bathroom.

474
00:20:29,090 --> 00:20:30,950
我真不敢相信你游遍了全国
I cannot believe you traveled the entire country

475
00:20:30,950 --> 00:20:32,640
却从没离开过火车站
and never left the train station.

476
00:20:32,640 --> 00:20:33,660
就是啊
I know.

477
00:20:33,660 --> 00:20:35,990
我差点在得梅因的火灾中丧生
You know, I almost died in a fire in Des Moines,

478
00:20:35,990 --> 00:20:37,830
但我坚持留在火车上
but I stayed put.

479
00:20:38,590 --> 00:20:39,560
顺便说下
FYI--

480
00:20:39,560 --> 00:20:42,000
当时泻立停的药效过了  我吓屎了
that's when the Imodium gave out.

